{
  "id": "section-woods-park-table",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Woods/park table (d6)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,22,44]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,44,46]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Werewolf attack! Werewolf, L4 Were, 8 Life, Damage 2. Silver\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,46,107]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "weapons hit the were at +2. It has a 2 in 6 chance of surprise. At the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,107,178]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "beginning of the encounter, you must save vs. L3 Fear or (choose):\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,178,245]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "lose 1 Sanity, or be at -1 on Defense rolls for the duration of the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,245,313]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "encounter. Any Escape roll against the werewolf is at -1. After you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,313,381]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have played this encounter twice in a game, ignore it and roll on the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,381,451]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Beasts table instead.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,451,473]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "2 Safe area. As soon as you step into this area, you heal either 1 Life\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,473,545]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "or 1 Sanity (your choice). This zone counts as a Safe House.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,545,606]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "3\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,606,608]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Slasher! Roll on the Slashers table. The encounter happens in the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,608,674]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "woods: the slasher gets a +1 to his/her chance of surprise but you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,674,741]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "get +1 to your Escape rolls.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,741,770]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "4\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,770,772]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Eerie area. There is a 2 in 6 chance that this place is a hell gate. If\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,772,844]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "so, you must also roll a 2 in 6 chance of a random encounter with a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,844,912]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "foe from the Demonic Horrors table. You may attempt to close the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,912,977]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "hell gate if you know the ritual and you have all the required\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,977,1040]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "equipment.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,1040,1051]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "5\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,1051,1053]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Werewolf Pack! You are chased by d3+1 werewolves. They have a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,1053,1115]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "2 in 6 chance of surprising you. They are L3 Weres, 1 Life point each,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,1115,1186]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Damage 1. At the beginning of the encounter, save vs. L3 Fear or\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,1186,1251]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "(choose) lose 1 Sanity or be at -1 on Defense rolls until the end of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,1251,1320]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "this encounter.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,1320,1336]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,1336,1338]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Hangman’s Tree. You find d6 corpses hanging from a tree. There\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,1338,1401]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "is nothing you can do for them: they are dead. There is a 1 in 6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,1401,1466]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "chance of finding a random object (roll on the Random Object or\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,1466,1530]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Useful Stuff table, your choice) for each corpse you take down from\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,1530,1598]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0032",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the tree. Every time you do so, you must save vs. L4 Fear (add +1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,1598,1664]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0033",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "for Will, +2 for Will Expert) or lose 1 Sanity. After you have played\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,1664,1734]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0034",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "this encounter twice in a game, ignore it and roll on the Beasts table\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,1734,1805]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-woods-park-table:p0035",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "instead.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[57,1805,1813]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    57
  ]
}
